      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  Li-Ning Summer Sale Intro Text Component with \"Shop All\" CTA\n  Sits perfectly between the hero banner (01_2.jpg) and the category cards.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<div class=\"lining-summer-intro\" id=\"intro-{{ section.id }}\">\n  <div class=\"lining-intro-container\">\n    <h2 class=\"intro-title\">\n      Sizzling Offers <span class=\"highlight-text\">Live Now</span>\n    </h2>\n    <p class=\"intro-description\">\n  Don't miss out on exclusive summer discounts across our entire collection of elite badminton gear.\n    </p>\n    \n    <!-- Shop All CTA Button -->\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"summer-divider\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .lining-summer-intro {\n    /* Blends seamlessly with the bottom of the hero banner and grid background */\n    background-color: #e3f7f2; \n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .lining-intro-container {\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  /* Matches the bold, aggressive \"SUMMER SALE\" typography aesthetic */\n  .intro-title {\n    font-family: 'Impact', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 5.5rem;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: #0c2340; /* Deep athletic navy */\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  /* Matches the bright orange/red from the banner text */\n  .highlight-text {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffaa00 0%, #ff4500 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    color: #ff4500; \n  }\n\n  /* Sleek, readable block description */\n  .intro-description {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 1.85rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #4a5568;\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto 24px auto;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  /* CTA Button Styling */\n  .intro-cta-wrapper {\n    margin-bottom: 35px;\n  }\n\n  .shop-all-btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;\nfont-weight:600;\n    font-size: 1.7rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9900 0%, #ff3300 100%);\n    padding: 14px 40px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 51, 0, 0.4);\n    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .shop-all-btn:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.04);\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 51, 0, 0.5);\n  }\n\n  /* Minimalist summer accent line separating the text from the image grid below */\n  .summer-divider {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #ff4500;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* Responsive Design for Mobile Devices */\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .lining-summer-intro {\n      padding: 35px 15px 20px 15px;\n    }\n    \n    .intro-title {\n      font-size: 4rem;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    .intro-description {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .shop-all-btn {\n      font-size: 1.55rem;\n      padding: 12px 32px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
